 "Wormification": "蠕虫化",
 "Welcome back once again Wizard, to the ruins of the universe.\n\nAeons passed while you slumbered.\nYou have sleptwalk across many worlds.\n\nWeep for Avalon, o lonely old Wizard!\nLove and beauty transmuted to chaos and ruin.\n\nYour beloved Avalon, and you, her loyal servant, as well.\n\nOnce a great Wizard,\nYour memories and magics have faded.\n\nNow a thirst for revenge awakens you.\nThe Dark Wizard Mordred is nearby.\n\nRegain your power.\nSlay Mordred.\nVengeance for Avalon.\n": "欢迎再次回到宇宙的废墟，法师。\n\n在你沉睡之际，亿万年岁月已然流逝。\n你曾梦游过无数世界。\n\n为阿瓦隆哭泣吧，孤独苍老的法师！\n爱与美已化为混沌与废墟。\n\n你挚爱的阿瓦隆，还有你，她忠实的仆从。\n\n你曾是伟大的法师，\n如今记忆与魔法都已消逝。\n\n此刻，复仇的渴望将你唤醒。\n黑暗法师莫德雷德就在附近。\n\n夺回你的力量。\n斩杀莫德雷德。\n为阿瓦隆复仇。\n",
 "\n[L:shields]: Show line of sight\n[T:shields]: Show threatened tiles\n[Y:shields]: Show threatening enemies\n\n[I:shields]: Highlight enemies\n[U:shields]: Highlight allies\n[O:shields]: Highlight objects\n\n[Tab:shields]: Next target\n[M:shields]: Show message log\n\n[V:shields]: Look (target a square to look, tab target to look at interesting places)\n[W:shields]: Walk (target a square to walk there, tab target to walk to interesting places)\n[A:shields]: Autopickup loot (after clearing level)\n\n[Shift + Up/Down Arrow:shields]: While in the character sheet, change selected spell hotkey or equipment position\n[Right Click:shields]: If hovering over a spell in the character panel, open that spell's upgrade menu\n[Period:shields]: Interact with the tile you are on (enter portal, open shop)\n\nSee the Rebind Controls menu for further controls / hotkeys\n": "\n[L:shields]：显示视线\n[T:shields]：显示受威胁格\n[Y:shields]：显示有威胁的敌人\n\n[I:shields]：高亮敌人\n[U:shields]：高亮友军\n[O:shields]：高亮物件\n\n[Tab:shields]：下一个目标\n[M:shields]：显示消息日志\n\n[V:shields]：查看（指定一格进行查看，按 Tab 选择查看有趣的地点）\n[W:shields]：行走（指定一格走过去，按 Tab 选择走到有趣的地点）\n[A:shields]：自动拾取战利品（清空本层后）\n\n[Shift + Up/Down Arrow:shields]：在角色面板中，更改所选法术的热键或装备位置\n[Right Click:shields]：悬停在角色面板中的法术上时，打开该法术的强化菜单\n[Period:shields]：与你所在格交互（进入传送门、打开商店）\n\n更多操作 / 热键请见重新绑定按键菜单\n",
 "\n[asseticon:stun] Stunned: Cannot act\n[asseticon:petrified] Petrified: Cannot act. Gain 100 Ice and Lightning resist. Gain 75 Physical and Fire resist\n[asseticon:glassed] Glassified: Cannot act. Gain 100 Ice and Lightning resist. Gain 75 Fire resist. Lose 100 Physical resist\n[asseticon:sleep] Sleep: Cannot act. Ends upon taking any damage that is not Arcane or Dark\n[asseticon:fear] Fear: Cannot willingly act. Each turn, automatically attempt to move away from enemies\n[asseticon:frozen] Frozen: Cannot act. Ends upon taking Fire or Physical damage. 100 Ice resist prevents and cures freezing\n[asseticon:poison] Poisoned: Take 1 Poison damage each turn and cannot heal. 100 Poison resist prevents and cures poison\n[asseticon:bleed] Bleed: Take 3 Physical damage each turn. 100 Physical resist prevents and cures bleeding\n[asseticon:necrosis] Necrosis: Lose 1 max HP each turn. 100 Dark resist prevents and cures necrosis\n[asseticon:soaked] Soaked: Gain 50 Fire resist. Lose 50 Ice and Lightning resist\n[asseticon:berserk] Berserked: Become hostile to all other units. May attack and be attacked by allies\n[asseticon:immobile] Immobilized: Cannot walk\n[asseticon:silence] Silenced: Cannot cast non-melee spells\n[asseticon:blind] Blind: All spell ranges reduced to 1\n\n[asseticon:quickcast] Quickcast: Casting spells uses only half of a turn\n[asseticon:quickmove] Quickstep: Moving uses only half of a turn\n[asseticon:channeling] Channeling: The spell's effect repeats on the same target until another action is taken\n[asseticon:reincarnation] Reincarnate: On death, come back to life at a random location on the map with full HP\n[asseticon:clarity] Clarity: Removes and prevents Stunned, Fear, Petrified, Glassified, Frozen, and Silenced\n": "\n[asseticon:stun] 眩晕：无法行动\n[asseticon:petrified] 石化：无法行动。获得 100 冰和闪电抗性。获得 75 物理和火焰抗性\n[asseticon:glassed] 玻璃化：无法行动。获得 100 冰和闪电抗性。获得 75 火焰抗性。失去 100 物理抗性\n[asseticon:sleep] 睡眠：无法行动。受到奥术或黑暗以外的任何伤害时结束\n[asseticon:fear] 恐惧：无法主动行动。每回合自动尝试远离敌人\n[asseticon:frozen] 冰冻：无法行动。受到火焰或物理伤害时结束。100 冰抗性可防止并解除冰冻\n[asseticon:poison] 中毒：每回合受到 1 点毒素伤害且无法治疗。100 毒素抗性可防止并解除中毒\n[asseticon:bleed] 流血：每回合受到 3 点物理伤害。100 物理抗性可防止并解除流血\n[asseticon:necrosis] 坏死：每回合失去 1 点最大生命值。100 黑暗抗性可防止并解除坏死\n[asseticon:soaked] 潮湿：获得 50 火焰抗性。失去 50 冰和闪电抗性\n[asseticon:berserk] 狂暴：对所有其他单位敌对。可以攻击友军，也会被友军攻击\n[asseticon:immobile] 定身：无法行走\n[asseticon:silence] 沉默：无法施放非近战法术\n[asseticon:blind] 致盲：所有法术射程降为 1\n\n[asseticon:quickcast] 快速施法：施放法术只消耗半个回合\n[asseticon:quickmove] 疾步：移动只消耗半个回合\n[asseticon:channeling] 引导：法术效果在同一目标上重复生效，直到执行其他动作\n[asseticon:reincarnation] 转生：死亡时，以满生命值在地图上的随机位置复活\n[asseticon:clarity] 清醒：移除并防止眩晕、恐惧、石化、玻璃化、冰冻和沉默\n",
 "\nUp to 10 spells and 2 upgrades for each can be purchased with SP\nAny number of equipments can be crafted using the components you find\n\nSpells and Equipment are only affected by bonuses to attributes in their tooltips\nAttribute bonuses come in the form of percent-based and flat bonuses, and are applied in that order\n\nSpells and Equipment can be filtered using the provided filters and with the search function\nFilters can be activated by clicking or SHIFT clicking the filter, or by using their hotkeys\nYou can begin searches with \\ to search for exact phrasing, i.e. \\ adds the fire tag\n\nSelecting equipment you cannot craft marks it as desired and adds it to your character panel\nLeft Click a desired item or use SHIFT 1 - 3 to craft it if possible or remove it otherwise\n\nWhen something says it casts a spell or gains a spell, it will use your version of that spell\nEven if you don't own the spell in question, any relevant bonuses you have will be applied\n\nExtra tooltips while examining Rifts and Components contain a Prospective Equipment page\nProspective Equipment cannot be crafted at that moment, but could if you had the component(s) in question\n\nEach level, you can reroll rifts once, closing the existing rifts and opening new ones\n\nMastery is the sum total SP cost of spells you own with a given tag, including applied upgrades\nHover over a tag filter in the Spell or Equipment shop to see your current mastery for that tag\n\n[SH:shields] or Shields, block an instance of damage, regardless of how large or small\n": "\n至多可用 SP 购买 10 个法术，每个法术还可购买 2 个强化\n可使用找到的组件制作任意数量的装备\n\n法术和装备只受其提示框中属性加成的影响\n属性加成分百分比加成和固定值加成两种，并按此顺序生效\n\n法术和装备可使用提供的筛选器和搜索功能来筛选\n点击或 SHIFT 点击筛选器即可激活，也可使用其热键\n搜索可用 \\ 开头来搜索精确短语，例如 \\ 会添加 fire 标签\n\n选择无法制作的装备会将其标记为想要，并加入你的角色面板\n左键点击想要的物品，或使用 SHIFT 1 - 3 在可行时制作它，否则将其移除\n\n当某物说明会施放或获得某个法术时，它将使用你的该法术版本\n即使你未拥有该法术，你具有的相关加成仍会生效\n\n检视裂隙和组件时的额外提示框包含「预期装备」页面\n预期装备当前无法制作，但若你拥有相应组件则可以制作\n\n每层你可以重掷一次裂隙，关闭现有裂隙并开启新裂隙\n\n精通是你所拥有的具有某标签的法术的 SP 总消耗，包括已应用的强化\n在法术或装备商店中悬停标签筛选器，可查看你当前对该标签的精通\n\n[SH:shields] 即护盾，可抵挡一次伤害，无论大小\n",
 "[Frozen] units cannot act\nFrozen units unfreeze upon taking [Fire] or [Physical] damage": "[冰冻:frozen]单位无法行动\n冰冻单位受到[火:fire]或[物理:physical]伤害时解除冰冻",
 "[Petrified] units cannot act\n[Petrified] units gain [100 Ice:ice] resist\n[Petrified] units gain [100 Lightning:lightning] resist\n[Petrified] units gain [75 Physical:physical] resist\n[Petrified] units gain [75 Fire:fire] resist": "[石化:petrified]单位无法行动\n[石化:petrified]单位获得 [100 冰:ice] 抗性\n[石化:petrified]单位获得 [100 闪电:lightning] 抗性\n[石化:petrified]单位获得 [75 物理:physical] 抗性\n[石化:petrified]单位获得 [75 火:fire] 抗性",
 "[Glassified] units cannot act\n[Glassified] units gain [-100 Physical:physical] resist\n[Glassified] units gain [100 Ice:ice] resist\n[Glassified] units gain [100 Lightning:lightning] resist\n[Glassified] units gain [75 Fire:fire] resist": "[玻璃化:glassified]单位无法行动\n[玻璃化:glassified]单位获得 [-100 物理:physical] 抗性\n[玻璃化:glassified]单位获得 [100 冰:ice] 抗性\n[玻璃化:glassified]单位获得 [100 闪电:lightning] 抗性\n[玻璃化:glassified]单位获得 [75 火:fire] 抗性",
 "[Stunned] units cannot act": "[眩晕:stunned]单位无法行动",
 "[Berserk] units are hostile to all other units, they will attack and be attacked by their allies": "[狂暴:berserk]单位对所有其他单位敌对，会攻击友军，也会被友军攻击",
 "[Poisoned:poison] units take 1 [Poison] damage each turn and cannot heal": "[中毒:poison]单位每回合受到 1 点[毒素:poison]伤害且无法治疗",
 "[Blind] units have all their spell ranges reduced to 1": "[致盲:blind]单位的所有法术射程降为 1",
