 "(Ignores LoS)": "（无视视线）",
 "\n\nAwaken, Wizard\n\nLong have you wandered amongst the stars\n\nWhile you rested, your deeds have become myth, and your powers faded to nought\nAges have come and gone, and Avalon has fallen into ruin\nYour ancient foe has risen once more\n\nMordred's hand reaches ever forth, his hunger endless, his malice without measure \nWhere his shadow falls, the world withers and cries out in torment\nIn the darkest night, your light sparks to life\n\nThe rift stands open\nAvalon calls her champion\n\nTake up your staff and your cloak\nGo forth, and slay Mordred\n\n": "\n\n苏醒吧，法师\n\n你已在群星之间流浪了漫长岁月\n\n当你沉眠时，你的功绩已成神话，你的力量也已消磨殆尽\n时代更迭流转，阿瓦隆已沦为废墟\n你的宿敌再度崛起\n\n莫德雷德之手不断伸出，他的饥渴永无止境，他的恶意深不可测\n他的阴影笼罩之处，世界枯萎凋零，在痛苦中哀号\n在最深的黑夜里，你的光芒重燃\n\n裂隙已然敞开\n阿瓦隆正在呼唤她的勇士\n\n拿起你的法杖，披上你的斗篷\n前进吧，斩杀莫德雷德\n\n",
 "Cooldown": "冷却",
